  "body": "click.Path exposes a path_type but does currently not use it for path sanity checks such as exists, file_okay, dir_okay etc.\nIf path_type is for instance a cloudpathlib.AnyPath and the cli user points to a S3 those checks will always go wrong since they expect path_type to handle only local paths.\nIssue #2661 addressed similar thoughts but when the path_type itself is pathlib compliant, I would hope that click.Path would honor the users wish to supply their own path_type.\n",
